{
  "$comment": "+++===+++ 2026-11-18 16:37 +04 — Hasan Alizada — HAAL-185. Test vectors for calendar.day_order.v2 (each expected order checked against an independent sort when written): every v1 case by time with colours that must not count, and the order by colour — the legacy colour rank (black, purple, green, blue, red, yellow, orange, brown), then the title itself (case counting), times not counting, then creation time and key.",
